# 🛡️ Network Layer Fraud Detection System

## Production-Ready TCP/IP + TLS + HTTP/2 Fingerprinting for Bot/Proxy/EC2 Detection

---

## 📋 Overview

A **pure network-layer fraud detection system** that identifies bots, headless browsers, EC2/cloud instances, and proxy relays **without relying on client-side JavaScript or easily spoofed signals like User-Agent**.

This system operates entirely at the **TCP/IP, TLS, and HTTP/2 layers** - signals that are **extremely difficult to spoof** because they originate from the operating system kernel and TLS library, not userland code.

---

