## 🔬 **Core Components**

### 1. **TCP Fingerprint** (Layer 1)
Captured from the SYN packet - **kernel-level, cannot be spoofed by userland code**

```go
type TCPFingerprint struct {
    // OS/Stack identity (HARD to spoof)
    OptionsOrder []string `json:"options_order"`  // TCP option sequence
    MSS          int      `json:"mss"`             // Path MTU
    Window       int      `json:"window"`          // TCP window size
    WindowScale  int      `json:"ws"`              // Window scaling
    SACK         bool     `json:"sack"`            // Selective ACK support
    TSPresent    bool     `json:"ts_present"`      // Timestamp support
    TTLBucket    int      `json:"ttl_bucket"`      // Hop count bucket
    ISNEntropy   float64  `json:"isn_entropy"`     // Sequence randomness
    TOS          int      `json:"tos"`             // QoS marking
    ECN          bool     `json:"ecn"`             // Congestion control
    DF           bool     `json:"df"`              // Don't fragment
    IPID         int      `json:"ip_id"`           // IP identification
    TSVal        uint32   `json:"ts_val"`          // Timestamp value
    HopCount     int      `json:"hop_count"`       // Network distance
}
```

### 2. **TLS Fingerprint** (Layer 2)
JA3/JA4 from ClientHello - **reveals the actual TLS library used**

```go
type TLSFingerprint struct {
    JA3          string   `json:"ja3"`            // Raw JA3 string
    JA3Hash      string   `json:"ja3_hash"`       // MD5(JA3)
    JA4          string   `json:"ja4"`            // Structured JA4
    TLSVersion   string   `json:"tls_version"`    // 1.2, 1.3
    CipherSuites []int    `json:"cipher_suites"`  // Cipher list
    Extensions   []int    `json:"extensions_order"` // Extension order
    ALPN         []string `json:"alpn"`           // Protocol negotiation
    SNI          string   `json:"sni"`            // Server Name Indicator
}
```

### 3. **HTTP/2 Fingerprint** (Layer 3)
SETTINGS frames and pseudo-headers - **reveals browser vs script**

```go
type H2Fingerprint struct {
    SettingsOrder      []string       `json:"settings_order"`
    SettingsValues     map[string]int `json:"settings_values"`
    PseudoHeaderOrder  []string       `json:"pseudo_header_order"`
    WindowUpdateIncr   int            `json:"window_update_incr"`
    PriorityUsed       bool           `json:"priority_used"`
    MatchesChrome      bool           `json:"matches_chrome"`
    MatchesFirefox     bool           `json:"matches_firefox"`
    MatchesBotLibrary  bool           `json:"matches_bot_library"`
}
```

### 4. **IP Intelligence** (Layer 4)
Geolocation and infrastructure detection - **cannot be spoofed**

```go
type IPIntelligence struct {
    ASN            int     `json:"asn"`             // Autonomous System
    ASNOrg         string  `json:"asn_org"`         // "AMAZON-AES", "GOOGLE"
    IsDatacenter   bool    `json:"is_datacenter"`   // Cloud/hosting
    IsResidential  bool    `json:"is_residential"`  // Home/office
    IsVPN          bool    `json:"is_vpn"`          // VPN provider
    CloudProvider  string  `json:"cloud_provider"`  // aws/gcp/azure
    RDNS           string  `json:"rdns"`            // Reverse DNS
    CountryCode    string  `json:"country_code"`    // Geographic location
    RTTMillis      int64   `json:"rtt_ms"`          // Round trip time
}
```

