## 🔍 **Detection Rules**

### TCP Fingerprint Comparison

| Field | Tolerance | Why |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| **MSS** | ±8 bytes | VPN/MTU path changes |
| **Window Scale** | ±1 | Proxy renegotiation |
| **SACK** | MUST match | Different TCP stack = proxy |
| **TS Present** | MUST match | Different OS = suspicious |
| **TTL Bucket** | ±1 | Normal route changes |
| **Options Order** | MUST match | Different stack = proxy |
| **ISN Entropy** | >0.3 | Low entropy = synthetic |

### Decision Matrix

| Score | Decision | Action | Confidence |
|-------|----------|--------|------------|
| **0-29** | ✅ **allow** | Grant access | High |
| **30-59** | ⚠️ **challenge** | Show CAPTCHA | Medium |
| **60-100** | 🚫 **block** | Reject request | High |

