## 🛡️ **Security Considerations**

### What This System Cannot Detect
- **Mutated JA3** - Advanced attackers can modify TLS stack
- **Custom TCP Stacks** - Custom kernel modules can spoof fingerprints
- **Local Bypass** - Attackers with local access can modify packets

### Defense in Depth
- Combine with **frontend signals** (canvas, WebGL, audio)
- Use **rate limiting** per session/IP
- Implement **progressive enforcement** (log → challenge → block)
- **Monitor false positives** continuously

